@HostAddress = http://localhost:5192

### 1. URL Path Versioning - V1 Students
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/Students/GetAll
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. URL Path Versioning - V2 Students (Enhanced with structured Name & Department)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v2/Students/GetAll
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Query String Versioning - V1 Products (?api-version=1.0)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?api-version=1.0
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Query String Versioning - V2 Products (?api-version=2.0 with Discount Calculation)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?api-version=2.0
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Header Versioning - V1 Users (X-API-Version: 1.0)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users
X-API-Version: 1.0
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Header Versioning - V2 Users (X-API-Version: 2.0 with FullName)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users
X-API-Version: 2.0
Accept: application/json

###
